T:Princess Royal
T:Miss MacDermott Roe
R:carolan
C:Turlough O'Carolan (1670-1738)
H:See also set dance#11 and set dance#7
H:It is dubious whether Carolan actually composed this tune. It was first
H:published in London in 1730, which would have been just five years after it
H:was composed. There are also many more versions in England, some in a minor
H:key, some in a major key. The Carolan claim originates with Bunting's source.
